    ("LOC_PEDIA_GREATWORK_PRODUCT_KHALIFA_8_BONUS",                   "+100% Theater Square district adjacency bonuses to this city."),
    ("LOC_PEDIA_GREATWORK_PRODUCT_KHALIFA_DESCRIPTION",               "[NEWLINE]When you built a certian [ICON_DISTRICT_WONDER] wonder or recruit certian [ICON_GreatPerson] Great Person, you can exploit [ICON_GreatWork_Product] products. Especially, when you built [ICON_DISTRICT_WONDER] Wonder Khalifa Tower, you can exploit {LOC_HD_PEDIA_CATEGORY_KHALIFA_NAME} that provide abundant bonuses. These [ICON_GreatWork_Product] products provide bonuses as follows:");


